<section style="padding:4rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;">
  <div class="container">
    <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1px;background:#000000;">
      <div style="background:#000;padding:2.5rem;">
        <p style="font-size:0.6rem;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#e00;margin-bottom:0.75rem;">Why SDF Clothing</p>
        <h2 style="font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:500;color:#fff;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Certified Garments Factory Bangladesh</h2>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;margin-bottom:1rem;">SDF Clothing has run an in-house Dhaka factory since 1998, combining knitting, dyeing, cutting, and sewing under one roof rather than subcontracting stages out to third parties. As certified <a href="/clothing-manufacturers/" style="color:#fff;border-bottom:1px solid #e00;text-decoration:none;">clothing manufacturers in Bangladesh</a>, we handle full OEM, ODM, and private label production from 300 pieces MOQ.</p>
        <p style="color:#FFFFFF;font-size:0.88rem;line-height:1.9;">Our Dhaka factory is ISO 9001 quality management certified, BSCI socially compliant, WRAP ethically accredited, and OEKO-TEX tested  ready for any market audit.</p>
      </div>
